    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1739290459\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1739290459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1739290459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Is Land of Mysterious is a singleplayer game<br>about surviving on the mysterious island.<br><br>You lost control from your plane and landed on the mysterious island.<br>Look like you're not alone in the island. Try to survive and leave island.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/f493d11fbe31d3155a065dd2efa95ad6.poster.avif?t=1739290459\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/f493d11fbe31d3155a065dd2efa95ad6.webm?t=1739290459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/f493d11fbe31d3155a065dd2efa95ad6.mp4?t=1739290459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It is a unique combination of the popular survive mechanic <br>with mysterious puzzle and philosophy traditions.<br>Game with a Spirit of Alternative history and various mythology.<br><br>The core gameplay is based around survival with puzzles and problem solving.<br>The player who solved more puzzles and find more secrets gets more trophy.<br>Such as achievements, rating, chests with equipment etc.<br>Find a way to leave the island!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resources and artifacts</h2>Gather resources and artifacts. Craft tools, equipment, weapons and environment.<br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build system</h2>Wake up yourself architect. Use the right resources and translate your fantasies.<br>There's a place on the island where your buildings are almost safe.<br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzles</h2>Open up the new corners of the island. Carry out different tasks and take your awards.<br>Many different regions of the island. Dangerous, amazing and interesting.<br>Solve puzzles and take your awards.<br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting</h2>A system of craft of various items from collected and recovered resources. Tools, weapons, household items.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1739290459\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1739290459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1739290459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Is Land of Mysterious is a singleplayer game<br>about surviving on the mysterious island.<br><br>You lost control from your plane and landed on the mysterious island.<br>Look like you're not alone in the island. Try to survive and leave island.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/f493d11fbe31d3155a065dd2efa95ad6.poster.avif?t=1739290459\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/f493d11fbe31d3155a065dd2efa95ad6.webm?t=1739290459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086790/extras/f493d11fbe31d3155a065dd2efa95ad6.mp4?t=1739290459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It is a unique combination of the popular survive mechanic <br>with mysterious puzzle and philosophy traditions.<br>Game with a Spirit of Alternative history and various mythology.<br><br>The core gameplay is based around survival with puzzles and problem solving.<br>The player who solved more puzzles and find more secrets gets more trophy.<br>Such as achievements, rating, chests with equipment etc.<br>Find a way to leave the island!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resources and artifacts</h2>Gather resources and artifacts. Craft tools, equipment, weapons and environment.<br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build system</h2>Wake up yourself architect. Use the right resources and translate your fantasies.<br>There's a place on the island where your buildings are almost safe.<br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzles</h2>Open up the new corners of the island. Carry out different tasks and take your awards.<br>Many different regions of the island. Dangerous, amazing and interesting.<br>Solve puzzles and take your awards.<br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting</h2>A system of craft of various items from collected and recovered resources. Tools, weapons, household items.</li></ul>",
